{"parse": {"title": "FW-06", "pageid": 25759, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FW-05\" title=\"FW-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FW-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/FW-07\" title=\"FW-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A3.B6.E4.B8.AD.E5.A4.A9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"壶中天\">壶中天</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 壶中天</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Limited Sky in the Teapot</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1660306</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>原来这些裂痕是修补后留下的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>我真想不到您是怎样用翅膀将它补得这样好。稍微拿远些看……几乎瞧不出任何缝隙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鸟儿也循着他的视线打量着桌面上的玉佩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我很久不曾再仔细瞧过它。今日再观，当时应是费了许多心思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>决定下山，有这故事的几分触动所致。因此借玉佩权作提醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-623712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-623712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-623712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>是为提醒自己，千万别干涉其他人的命运？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>也为时时想起两族相似之处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>同您比起来，我的见识实在少得可怜，要是说错了什么话，您别见怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他试探地抚摸着玉佩的边缘，随后松开手，坐直身子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>它摸起来和骨头也挺相似。说起来，我还不知道您从我身上这副骨头看出了些什么——算了，您可千万别告诉我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>起初我还以为您只是能借此探查谎言，要是能把我的现在、过去、未来都一并瞧个清楚，那我可一点都不好奇了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>如果我的结局不是死在自己收集来的故事堆里，手边也没有精细的骨雕，我现在就会失去求生意志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我并未看得这样多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>“并未”！那您是能做到的了！请您务必对看到的内容守口如瓶，要比蜡封了嘴巴还严实。噢，原谅我有些粗俗的措辞，这实在有些……惊人。是的，惊人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>你的感想很有趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>离开后，我在山下所见，的确远胜于借由骨头所读到的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>或许我的族人也只是偶然遭逢，只打算看过便罢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>打了照面，便有了牵绊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>如你所说，新奇之物向来令人瞩目。若是仔细琢磨，往往陷于其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我便是这样习得了书画、乐器、诸多工艺，也背下了不少诗文典籍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>我了解骨雕技艺也是因为买到了一柄漂亮的小刀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>您不知道，它刀身镶嵌的薄骨片，让灯一照就有珍珠和贝母般的光泽……可它却是骨头。在火底下，它简直像活的……于是我再难以挪开目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>您的族人也可能是在无意中发觉了这件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>何事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>令死物复活的技艺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>木头、骨头、金属或是泥土，用它们塑出生物的外形，这是一种。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>往物件中灌注故事，这是另一种。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>先前见到您的骨杖和玉佩时，我理所当然地想着，自然是带有神秘术气息的物件更贵重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>但听完您所讲的，我再见到它们，记起的，却只有您说的话了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>载有故事的物件自然不可代替，它们比空白时更具价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>是一桩道理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>接触掌握技艺的人，才能有机会习得它。但，您瞧。在这过程中，又生出许多新的经历……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻人骤然打住了话头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>喔——抱歉，我有些口渴。您从东方来，应该有饮茶的习惯吧。正好，正好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>分部刚添了一批茶炊，我先煮上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>外壳锃亮的器皿占据了桌面绝大部分空间，年轻人正细心地为其点火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>此物便利，设计者是位巧匠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>原先没有这样的工具，我们喝茶喝得多了，就自然有了许多要求——为茶保温，要防风，要便利，随手就能取来用，最好还能便于放置配茶用的糕饼点心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-623710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-623710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-623710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>不过，要是不知道有茶叶这样东西，就不会有工匠去研究茶炊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杯中逐渐盛满琥珀色的茶汤，热气蒸腾，在鸟儿的羽翼侧面结出一串水珠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>可一但知道，总会有工匠去尝试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>他们掌握了制作茶炊的工艺，就会希望有所改进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>“创造”才是其中真正令人上瘾的成分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鸟儿咀嚼着这个词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他与族人的确不曾研究出什么新的技艺，或是这种便利的物件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们所做的更多是摹仿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摹仿山下人的语言、文字、行为。摹仿死去的族人所记取的内容，为此耗费漫长的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我与族人都不曾创造过任何东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>若就是它使得我们下山……大概从最开始我们就找错了方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>徒劳而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鸟儿为自己的疑问画上了一个简单的注脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是恰好穿过针眼的那根线，适时撞响的钟声，他从未想到，又早有准备的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>您想得太多了！能发明茶炊的人只是那么一小撮——就像猫背上几根抖擞的毛发那样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>有人做出茶炊，我就买来煮茶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>人人都能煮茶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>但别人可未必能煮出我喜欢的口味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>您这股爱往死胡同闯的劲儿还真像极了刻板印象里的神秘学家……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>我雕不出您那根朴素自然的骨杖，您煮不出我这杯拿手的茶。事情就是这样，没什么大不了的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>让您挂念的那个原因，把它归为好奇心也好，说成是其他也成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>你们大概是想寻得某种途径吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>对能勘察骨相的“仙人”而言，交流并非难事，无需寻觅途径。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>瞧，您又一次飞进了死胡同！有了茶炊，我才能煮茶——见过足够多的东西，你们才知道什么是仅有自己能做的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻人摆了摆手，喝了一口热茶，五官立刻滑稽地皱成了团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-623713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-623713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-623713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>呸、呸呸！该死，怎么这样苦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>您——您还没尝，真是万幸——一定是茶叶放得太多，该死！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>我马上替您重新煮一壶，立刻就去……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>无妨，我来便可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>……哦，这真是……谢谢您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>糖还是蜜？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>我家的村子里用蜂蜜更多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鸟儿点了点头，凝视着桌上的器皿，稍稍抬起羽翼。铜制小壶随之自动倾斜，注满水杯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>噢，我的那份请倒在这儿，茶碟里边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他舀一勺蜜糖送入口中，托起瓷碟，从边缘吮着茶汤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>这样的喝法我却是头回见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>您要是还打算在这里停留几日，恐怕早晚会习惯。大家喝茶图个热闹愉快，都拣最顺手的办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>也好，又是一样新见识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>壶中的热气冉冉上升，室内的人与物都陷入温和的、短暂的停滞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蒸汽化作成团白雾，年轻人隔着这层白色望去，逐渐看不清鸟儿的面目，也瞧不见冰冷但可靠的墙壁。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>或者说，那并非他所熟悉的墙壁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-623714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-623714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-623714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>什么——？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>您起初说您不了解人工梦游！这不符合我所知的操作规范，您从哪儿弄来的权限！您——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我并无“权限”，也的确是第一次体验它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>几刻前我告知你，我见过与它相仿的神秘术。你难道这便忘记了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>判断您是否具有威胁，这是我的职责。如果过早地让您知晓这点，您的回答就会丧失相当的可信度。相信我们都不愿看到这种结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>现在……我们的确还在人工梦游之内。这是我对您隐瞒的唯一内容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>如果您对此感到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我早知你的意图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鸟儿平淡地陈述着这一事实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>因此，我才实在不解你们的矛盾之举。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>但先前的交谈也令我有些收获。我想，如你所说，亲眼所见之物最是动人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>……于是，才借机带你一观。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FW-06"}}